#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:175
msgid ""
"Enable sensor threshold detection; changing this gate resets the firmware threshold history. "
"Repeated calls are safe. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "启用传感器阈值检测；更改此开关会重置固件阈值历史，可重复调用，设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:177 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:195
#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:235 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:275
#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:315 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:356
