#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:525 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:545
#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:591
msgid "No return value."
msgstr "无返回值。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:193
msgid ""
"Disable sensor threshold detection; changing this gate resets the firmware threshold history. "
"Repeated calls are safe. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "禁用传感器阈值检测；更改此开关会重置固件阈值历史，可重复调用，设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:211
msgid "Check whether sensor threshold detection is enabled."
msgstr "查询传感器阈值检测是否已启用。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:213 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:430
msgid "True if enabled, otherwise False."
msgstr "启用时返回 True，否则返回 False。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:229
msgid ""
"Set the illuminance threshold window. The firmware briefly restarts measurement and resets the "
"threshold history. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置照度阈值窗口。固件会短暂重启测量并重置阈值历史；设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:231
msgid "Lower threshold in lux, 0..2516580; must be less than high."
msgstr "照度下限，单位 lux，范围 0..2516580，必须小于 high。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:233
msgid "Upper threshold in lux, 0..2516580; must be greater than low."
msgstr "照度上限，单位 lux，范围 0..2516580，必须大于 low。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:253
msgid "Get the configured illuminance threshold window."
msgstr "读取配置的照度阈值窗口。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:255
msgid "Tuple (low, high), in lux."
msgstr "元组 (low, high)，单位 lux。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:271
msgid "Set measurement gain. The setting is volatile. Measurement restarts and thresholds are reapplied."
msgstr "设置测量增益，设置不写入 Flash。测量会重启，并重新应用阈值。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:273 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:295
msgid "Gain multiplier: GAIN_1X, GAIN_3X, GAIN_6X, GAIN_9X or GAIN_18X."
msgstr "增益倍数：GAIN_1X、GAIN_3X、GAIN_6X、GAIN_9X 或 GAIN_18X。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:293
msgid "Get measurement gain."
msgstr "读取测量增益。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:311
msgid ""
"Set measurement resolution. The setting is volatile. The current interval must strictly exceed "
"the conversion time: 16/17/18/19/20 bits require 25/50/100/200/400 ms respectively. The firmware "
"rejects incompatible combinations."
msgstr "设置测量分辨率，掉电不保存。当前测量间隔必须严格大于转换时间：16/17/18/19/20 bit 分别对应 25/50/100/200/400 ms。固件会拒绝不兼容的组合。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:313 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:336
msgid "A RESOLUTION_*BIT constant, in bits: 16, 17, 18, 19 or 20."
msgstr "RESOLUTION_*BIT 常量，单位 bit：16、17、18、19 或 20。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:334
msgid "Get measurement resolution."
msgstr "读取测量分辨率。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:352
msgid ""
"Set measurement interval. The setting is volatile. The interval must strictly exceed the "
"conversion time: 20/19/18/17/16 bits require 400/200/100/50/25 ms respectively. Use 500 ms or "
"longer for any resolution. The unsupported 25 ms setting is rejected before I/O."
msgstr ""
"设置测量间隔，掉电不保存。间隔必须严格大于转换时间：20/19/18/17/16 bit 分别对应 400/200/100/50/25 ms。500 ms 及以上适用于所有分辨率。不支持的 25"
" ms 设置会在通信前被拒绝。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:354
msgid "A MEASUREMENT_INTERVAL_*MS constant: 50, 100, 500, 1000 or 2000 ms."
msgstr "MEASUREMENT_INTERVAL_*MS 常量：50、100、500、1000 或 2000 ms。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:374
msgid "Get measurement interval."
msgstr "读取测量间隔。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:376
msgid "Interval in milliseconds. Allowed: (25, 50, 100, 500, 1000, 2000)."
msgstr "间隔，单位毫秒。可选值：(25, 50, 100, 500, 1000, 2000)。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:392
msgid ""
"Enable threshold event reporting; sensor threshold detection must also be enabled. Repeated calls"
" are safe. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "启用阈值事件上报；还需要启用传感器阈值检测，可重复调用，设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:410
msgid "Disable threshold event reporting. Repeated calls are safe. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "禁用阈值事件上报，可重复调用，掉电不保存。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:428
msgid ""
"Check whether threshold event reporting is enabled. Events require both reporting and threshold "
"detection to be enabled."
msgstr "查询阈值事件上报是否已启用。产生事件需要同时启用上报和阈值检测。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:446
msgid ""
"Register one event callback, replacing the previous callback. Registration does not change device"
" reporting settings. The callback receives one integer. Do not call Chain methods inside the "
"callback; record the event for the main loop. Events: 0 means below the lower threshold, 1 means "
"above the upper threshold. Returning inside the window does not emit a recovery event."
msgstr ""
"注册一个事件回调并替换此前的回调，不改变设备上报设置。回调接收一个整数参数。请在回调中记录事件，由主循环处理，不要在回调内调用 Chain 方法。事件值：0 为低于下限，1 "
"为高于上限。回到阈值窗口内不会发送恢复事件。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:448
msgid "Function called with the event integer; None unregisters it."
msgstr "接收事件整数的函数；None 表示注销回调。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:467
msgid "Read the internal sensor I2C register space through Chain. This may clear sensor status registers."
msgstr "通过 Chain 读取内部传感器 I2C 寄存器；读取操作可能清除传感器状态位。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:469 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:497
msgid "Seven-bit internal I2C address, 0x08..0x77."
msgstr "内部 I2C 七位地址，范围 0x08..0x77。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:471 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:499
msgid "Register address, 0..255 for addrsize=8 or 0..65535 for addrsize=16."
msgstr "寄存器地址：addrsize=8 时为 0..255，addrsize=16 时为 0..65535。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:473
msgid "Number of bytes, 1..64."
msgstr "读取字节数，范围 1..64。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:475 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:503
msgid "Register address width in bits, 8 or 16. Default: 8."
msgstr "寄存器地址位宽，8 或 16；默认为 8。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:477
msgid "Requested register bytes."
msgstr "请求的寄存器字节。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:495
msgid ""
"Write the internal sensor I2C register space through Chain. Direct register writes can change "
"measurement and alarm configuration; use sensor-specific configuration methods for normal "
"operation."
msgstr "通过 Chain 写入内部传感器 I2C 寄存器。直接写寄存器可能改变测量和告警配置；常规操作请使用传感器专用配置方法。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:501
msgid "Buffer containing 1..64 bytes."
msgstr "包含 1..64 字节的缓冲区。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:523
msgid ""
"Detach this object and its callbacks. Repeated calls are safe. Hardware configuration and the "
"shared ChainBus remain active."
msgstr "注销此对象及其回调，可重复调用。硬件配置和共享 ChainBus 保持运行。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:539
msgid ""
"Set the base RGB color. Firmware alarm or Pedal overlays can temporarily cover this color. This "
"setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置基础 RGB 颜色。固件告警或踏板叠加灯效可能暂时覆盖此颜色；此设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:541 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:567
msgid "RGB888 color, 0x000000..0xFFFFFF."
msgstr "RGB888 颜色，范围 0x000000..0xFFFFFF。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:543 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:565
msgid "Base LED index; 0 for sensors, 0..3 for Pedal. Default: 0."
msgstr "基础灯索引：传感器为 0，Pedal 为 0..3；默认为 0。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:563
msgid "Get the configured base RGB color, excluding firmware overlays."
msgstr "读取配置的基础 RGB 颜色，不包含固件叠加灯效。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:585
msgid "Set the global RGB brightness. Saving writes device flash."
msgstr "设置全局 RGB 亮度，保存操作会写入设备 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:587 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:611
msgid "Brightness in percent, 0..100."
msgstr "亮度百分比，范围 0..100。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:589
msgid "Save this setting to device flash. Default: False."
msgstr "是否将此设置保存到设备 Flash；默认为 False。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:609
msgid "Get the global RGB brightness."
msgstr "读取全局 RGB 亮度。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:627
msgid "Get the device UID."
msgstr "读取设备 UID。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:629
msgid "UID_4_BYTES (0) or UID_12_BYTES (1). Default: UID_4_BYTES (0)."
msgstr "UID_4_BYTES（0，4 字节）或 UID_12_BYTES（1，12 字节）。默认：UID_4_BYTES（0）。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:631
msgid "Four or twelve UID bytes."
msgstr "四个或十二个 UID 字节。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:649
msgid "Get the bootloader version."
msgstr "读取引导程序版本。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:651 ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:669
#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:687
msgid "Device-reported numeric identifier."
msgstr "设备返回的数值标识。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:667
msgid "Get the firmware version."
msgstr "读取固件版本。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/dlight.rst:685
msgid "Get the device type."
msgstr "读取设备类型。"

msgid "DLight illuminance display"
msgstr "DLight 照度显示"

msgid "Open the |m5core_chain_dlight_basic_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |m5core_chain_dlight_basic_example.m5f2| 项目。"

msgid ""
"Connect Chain DLight as the first device on M5Stack Basic UART2 (TX=21, RX=22). The screen "
"displays the live illuminance in lux."
msgstr "将 Chain DLight 接为 M5Stack Basic UART2（TX=21、RX=22）上的第一个设备。屏幕实时显示照度值，单位 lux。"

msgid "Bases: :py:class:`~chain.key.KeyChain`"
msgstr "基类：:py:class:`~chain.key.KeyChain`"

msgid "Driver for Chain DLight."
msgstr "Chain DLight 驱动。"

msgid "Detach the device and release all callbacks; the shared bus stays open."
msgstr "注销设备并清除全部回调，保留共享总线。"

msgid "Repeated calls are safe. Returns None."
msgstr "可重复调用，无返回值。"

msgid ""
"Set the illuminance alarm threshold window. The firmware briefly restarts measurement and resets "
"the threshold history. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置照度报警阈值。设置时会短暂重新启动测量，并清除阈值状态记录；设置不保存到 Flash。"

msgid "Get the configured illuminance alarm threshold window."
msgstr "读取当前照度报警阈值。"

msgid "Register a threshold callback without changing hardware reporting gates."
msgstr "注册阈值事件回调，不改变硬件事件上报设置。"

msgid ""
"set_event_callback(EVENT_LOW/HIGH, callback) replaces only that event's handler; None removes it."
" Callbacks receive the event integer. The legacy set_event_callback(callback) form replaces all "
"handlers with one handler for both events; set_event_callback(None) removes all handlers. The two"
" forms replace one another. Do not call Chain methods inside a callback."
msgstr ""
"set_event_callback(EVENT_LOW/HIGH, callback) 仅替换所选事件的回调，传入 None 可注销该回调。回调参数为事件整数。旧形式 "
"set_event_callback(callback) 使用一个回调处理两种事件，并替换全部已有回调；set_event_callback(None) "
"注销全部回调。两种注册形式会相互替换。请勿在回调中调用 Chain 设备接口。"

msgid "EVENT_LOW (0), EVENT_HIGH (1), or a legacy callback/None."
msgstr "EVENT_LOW（0）、EVENT_HIGH（1），或旧形式的回调函数/None。"

msgid "Event handler, or the legacy keyword handler when event is None."
msgstr "事件回调函数；event 为 None 时，也可用于旧形式的关键字回调参数。"
